a-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wèi\" data-defn=\"classifier for people (honorific)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">位</span><span class=\"tr\">位</span><rt>wèi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù mén\" data-defn=\"department / branch / section / division\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">部门</span><span class=\"tr\">部門</span><rt>bù mén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jīng lǐ\" data-defn=\"manager / director\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">经理</span><span class=\"tr\">經理</span><rt>jīng lǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lì kè\" data-defn=\"immediately; at once; right away\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">立刻</span><span class=\"tr\">立刻</span><rt>lì kè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"huí dá\" data-defn=\"to reply; to answer / reply; answer\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">回答</span><span class=\"tr\">回答</span><rt>huí dá</rt></ruby>：”<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiān\" data-defn=\"beforehand; first; earlier / at first; originally / for the time being; for now\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">先</span><span class=\"tr\">先</span><rt>xiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jī\" data-defn=\"fowl / chicken\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">鸡</span><span class=\"tr\">雞</span><rt>jī</rt></ruby>。”<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǎo bǎn\" data-defn=\"boss / business proprietor\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">老板</span><span class=\"tr\">老闆</span><rt>lǎo bǎn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiē zhe\" data-defn=\"then / after that / subsequently / in turn / in one&#x27;s turn\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">接着<